# Zero Trust Architecture Component Mapping

## 1. Policy Decision Point (PDP)

### Current Capabilities

- Local authentication controls
- AppArmor security policies
- Polkit authorization
- Dynamic firewall rules

### Current Limitation

The current model mainly performs local security enforcement.

### Recommended Improvement

**Implement a centralized Policy Decision Point (PDP) capable of evaluating:**

- User identity
- Device identity
- Security posture
- Application trust level
- Network context
- Threat intelligence

